e.com/rss/articles/CBMiVEFVX3lxTE5pNG90WnlDSGVJQzc2dlpFMVktX1RPRzRlR3NXd3dHaTM0dWpka1k0TTkxLTVLNUVhZEV6VGN6bzVyZmNLVGFnS3dOMVhyXzBoeGpvZw?oc=5","date":"2026-11-06"}],"events":[{"date":"2026-10-28","type":"corporate","what":"董事 RSU 股份交易","what_en":"Director RSU share dealings","ann":"11693177","link":"https://www.klsescreener.com/v2/announcements/view/11693177","src":"ai"},{"date":"2026-12-31","type":"results_due","what":"下一季 (10 月底结束) 季报最迟公布日 · 交易所规定","what_en":"Deadline for the quarter ending Oct (Bursa rule)","src":"rule"}],"recent_en":"Yinson's recent focus is a privatization proposal by a MISC-led consortium at RM2.50 per share, valued at about RM4.03 bil. The company said it has not accepted the proposal, while CIMB Securities advised shareholders to vote in favour and CGS noted the deal may expose MISC shareholders to higher risks. EPF and KWAP have also reported changes in their shareholdings.","notable_en":["A MISC-led consortium proposed to privatize Yinson at RM2.50 per share, valued at about RM4.03 bil.","Yinson said it has not accepted the privatization proposal.","CIMB Securities advised shareholders to vote in favour of the buyout."],"risks_en":["CGS noted that MISC's RM3.03 bil bet to take Yinson private may expose MISC shareholders to higher risks.","EPF and KWAP recently reported changes in their shareholdings, indicating shifts among major shareholders."],"earnings_en":"For the quarter ended 2026-07-31, revenue was MYR 1,136 mil, up 8.3% QoQ but down 16.7% YoY; net income was MYR 128 mil, up 6.7% QoQ and 26.7% YoY; net margin was 11.3% versus 11.4% in the previous quarter."}